  "scale": "small",
  "summary": "RSTP (802.1w) triangle of 3 access switches. Root bridge elected (lowest priority), one port on each non-root switch becomes root port (lowest root-path-cost), remaining redundant link is put in BLOCKING to prevent the loop. Convergence <1s via proposal/agreement.",
  "tags": [
    "stp",
    "rstp",
    "spanning-tree",
    "l2",
    "loop-prevention",
    "access",
    "root-bridge",
    "bpdu"
  ],
